    {
      "id": "claim_da877b92ae4044a88b8584a9801de626",
      "statement": "An article reaches the scoring queue via two independent paths: InterestScoringListener enqueues newly ingested article ids on ArticlesIngestedEvent (uncapped by sweep-batch-size), and InterestScoringSweep periodically enqueues up to min(free queue room, sweep-batch-size) eligible articles, newest first.",
