      "id": "claim_35b786f5a0ae47748408d4d4fd690d9a",
      "statement": "InterestScoringSweep skips a run entirely when Jev is unconfigured, when the jev circuit breaker is OPEN or FORCED_OPEN, or during cold start, but runs while the breaker is HALF_OPEN so scoring resumes automatically after the breaker's timed transition.",
      "evidence": [
        {
