    {
      "id": "claim_48ce3e21e0e24ceba9207cfc6e659d29",
      "statement": "ScoringQueue tracks in-flight article ids in a ConcurrentHashMap-backed set, silently skipping an id already queued or running, and releases an id's in-flight marker on TaskRejectedException (executor queue full) so the next sweep run can retry it rather than leaving it stuck.",
