    {
      "id": "claim_91caaa9e4f23473db1421e491f5cb881",
      "statement": "ArticleScoringService.score snapshots the interest profile's and every topic's version before calling JevApiClient.judge, and after the call returns it discards the judgment (writing no row and consuming no attempt) if the profile version or any topic's version-set changed in the meantime, leaving the article for the sweep to re-pick against the current rubric.",
