      "statement": "ArticleScoringService classifies a transient Jev failure (429, 5xx, connection/timeout, open breaker, missing key, 401/403) as writing no article_score row and burning no attempt, while any other failure (invalid answer, non-transient exception) writes a FAILED row and consumes one of three allowed attempts.",
