      "id": "claim_ac42d8a735c744aa9296a49f7f59ff2c",
      "statement": "Engagement opens are captured client-side via useOpenOriginal, which calls window.open synchronously first (preserving user activation) and then sends a fire-and-forget, bodyless PUT /api/articles/{id}/engagement/open whose errors are swallowed with no toast; only a successful PUT triggers the post-engagement reaction.",
