    {
      "id": "claim_eb30ba35452141b0a99860f5bff66747",
      "statement": "Engagement saves (STAR, BOARD, RAINDROP) are captured server-side through ArticleEngagementStore.recordQuietly, a quiet ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING insert that never throws, called from ArticleService.updateState (unstarred-to-starred only), BoardService.addArticle, and RaindropService after createBookmark succeeds, with none of these call sites holding a transaction so a failed engagement write can never abort the user's save.",
