    {
      "id": "claim_39cebea56a10474787c486f8fca9c459",
      "statement": "afterEngagement/invalidateAfterLearnedChange refresh the frontend after an engagement action by invalidating interest/learned, interest/suggestions, articles, and other open by-id article queries, and refetching the acted-on article with staleTime 0, but deliberately never invalidate, reset, or refetch the priority query itself, so the Priority list a user is triaging never resorts; on the Priority route it only patches the affected row in place and sets a rankingChanged flag when the refetched score differs.",
