    {
      "id": "claim_5bd074ddf9f941e2b2d69056b4770fa8",
      "statement": "The learned-weight blend's LearnedLimit.of names which single rule bound a topic's effective weight, evaluated in precedence order LEARNED_CAP (uncapped thumbs points reach the learned cap) then SIGN_CLAMP (base+learned crosses zero) then WEIGHT_RANGE (|base+learned| exceeds 50) then ENGAGEMENT_CAP (only reported when no stronger bound applies and uncapped engagement points reach the engagement cap) then NONE; engagementAtCap is a separate boolean usable even when a stronger limit is reported.",
      "evidence": [
