      "statement": "TopicSuggestionStore's near-miss candidate predicate requires an article to have at least one article_engagement row whose kind's first recording falls within the last 30 days (TopicSuggestionService.WINDOW_DAYS), a SCORED article_score row, no article_feedback row, no topic_suggestion_dismissal row, and a best noul across all article_topic_score rows below myfeeder.interest.suggestions.near-miss (default 0.35).",
