    {
      "id": "claim_a1530aedb1d741e3aae6c4aec8f583d4",
      "statement": "TopicSuggestionService.list orders candidates by badge ascending (re-derived from InterestScoreQueries.displayScores in a separate step that never touches the ranking SQL or the dismissal table), then by latest engagement newest-first, then by article id descending, caps the returned items at MAX_SUGGESTIONS (10), reports a separate total count of all qualifying candidates, and drops (without counting) any candidate whose badge disappeared between the two lookup steps; the entire gap-discovery flow never calls Jev.",
