      "statement": "The operational throttle levers for the interest-scoring sweep are myfeeder.interest.sweep-batch-size (default 50) and myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay (default PT2M) for a committed change, an emergency kubectl set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE override for an immediate fix that must be removed once the tuned value is committed to yaml, and redeploying with MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY unset for a full emergency stop; myfeeder.interest.concurrency is kept at 1 by design.",
